00:08:16.117 --> 00:08:21.917
from NVIDIA, and AMCORE has nearly $3 billion of agreements, including prepayments,

00:08:22.057 --> 00:08:24.637
to expand packaging in Arizona and South Korea.

00:08:25.377 --> 00:08:30.837
Samsung Electro Mechanics and Foxconn have expanded partnerships as well, and NVIDIA said

00:08:30.837 --> 00:08:35.077
